            <ArticleTitle>A new technique to guarantee access to the sidebranch during bifurcational coronary stenting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>25-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two consecutive patients are treated using a new technique whereby a stent is implanted across a sidebranch but access to the sidebranch is never lost, thereby guaranteeing further treatment with balloon dilatation or stenting as required.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
